sequenceDiagram
    participant C as ClientApplicationRuntime
    participant AuthI as AuthenticationContract
    participant PresI as PresenceContract
    participant MsgI as MessagingContract
    participant FileI as FileTransferContract
    participant SessionI as SessionManagementContract
    participant AuditI as AuditAdministrationContract

    Note over C, AuditI: Interface Communication Flow
    C->>AuthI: LoginRequest(credentials)
    AuthI-->>C: SessionContext + AuthResult
    C->>PresI: SubscribePresence(clientID)
    PresI-->>C: ActiveUserSnapshot
    
    C->>MsgI: RouteMessage(EncryptedPayload)
    MsgI-->>C: DistributionEvent + PushedMessage
    C->>SessionI: AppendBuffer(messageChunk)
    SessionI-->>C: BufferSnapshot + MemoryUsageReport
    
    C->>FileI: InitiateTransfer(fileMetadata)
    FileI-->>C: TransferSessionToken
    C->>MsgI: RouteMessage(TransferNotification)
    
    C->>AuditI: AdminInventoryRequest(adminToken)
    AuditI-->>C: ActiveUserReport + LogRecords
    
    C->>AuthI: RevokeSession(LogoutRequest)
    AuthI-->>C: TokenRevocationEvent
    PresI-->>C: PresenceBroadcast(OfflineUpdate)